*.jar
*.bin

# Real-world user backup corpus (124 third-party rigs named after their owners) — a local-only
# codec-validation fixture. Not redistributed; tests/test_roundtrip.py skips it when absent.
reference/sysex_dumps/LF+ Editor Sysex Files/

# The entire reference/ tree is private, non-redistributed material (device dumps,
# decompiled sources, FAMC files) — tests skip cleanly when it's absent. Also private:
# the original-app UI captures and the golden CSVs (both derived from the reference rig).
reference/
docs/ui/*.png
tests/fixtures/golden_csv/

